<section class="sec home-sec" aria-labelledby="topics-h"><div class="wrap">
  <h2 class="sec-h" id="topics-h">Topics</h2>
  <ul class="topic-grid">
    <li><a href="/azure-landing-zone/">
      <img src="/img/icons/landing-zone.svg" width="32" height="32" alt="">
      <strong>Azure Landing Zone</strong>
      <span class="tg-d">What a landing zone is and how to plan one, from ownership and identity to networking and rollout.</span>
      <span class="tg-n">{{ list | inSeries('alz') | length }} articles</span>
    </a></li>
    <li><a href="/azure-virtual-desktop/">
      <img src="/img/icons/avd.svg" width="32" height="32" alt="">
      <strong>Azure Virtual Desktop</strong>
      <span class="tg-d">How it is built, how it fails, and how to plan identity, networking, profiles and images.</span>
      <span class="tg-n">{{ list | inSeries('avd-series') | length }} articles</span>
    </a></li>
    <li><a href="/windows-365-enterprise/">
      <img src="/img/icons/cloud-pc.svg" width="32" height="32" alt="">
      <strong>Windows 365</strong>
      <span class="tg-d">A Cloud PC from licensing and network choices to Intune management, for a first pilot.</span>
      <span class="tg-n">{{ list | inSeries('w365-series') | length }} articles</span>
    </a></li>
    <li><a href="/labs/">
      <img src="/img/icons/labs.svg" width="32" height="32" alt="">
      <strong>Labs</strong>
      <span class="tg-d">Hands-on Azure basics and Terraform labs, each with steps and a way to check the result.</span>
      <span class="tg-n">{{ (list | inSeries('azure-basics-lab') | length) + (list | inSeries('terraform-lab') | length) }} articles</span>
    </a></li>
  </ul>
</div></section>

<section class="sec home-sec" aria-labelledby="new-h"><div class="wrap">
  <h2 class="sec-h" id="new-h">Latest articles</h2>
  <ul class="alist alist-2">
    {%- for p in list | mixLatest(articleMeta, 6, 2) %}{% set ser = p.data.tags | seriesOf %}{% set showSeries = true %}{% include "row.njk" %}{% endfor %}
  </ul>
  <p class="all"><a href="/articles/">All articles</a></p>
</div></section>

<section class="sec home-sec" aria-labelledby="start-h"><div class="wrap">
  <h2 class="sec-h" id="start-h">Start here</h2>
  <div class="paths">
    <a class="path" href="/azure-basics-labs/">
      <strong>New to Azure</strong>
      <span>Begin with the Azure basics labs: a free account, identity, networking, a virtual machine and storage, one short lab at a time.</span>
      <span class="pn">{{ list | inSeries('azure-basics-lab') | length }} articles</span>
    </a>
    <a class="path" href="/azure-virtual-desktop/troubleshoot-avd-start-here/">
      <strong>Running Azure Virtual Desktop</strong>
      <span>Start with the troubleshooting guide. It sends you to the right check for a black screen, a profile that will not load, a sign-in failure or a host that will not register.</span>
      <span class="pn">Troubleshooting guide</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</div></section>
